DESCRIPTION:Join us for craft night led by Tilly Goose! Tickets include a p
 int of draft beer or a glass of house wine.\n\nSign up here: https://www.ev
 entbrite.com/e/blankets-brews-at-chilly-hollow-tickets-1976498903426\n\nCom
 e chill for a cozy and creative evening making your very own blankets! This
  workshop will guide you through the process of crafting a warm and stylish
  blanket that you can take home with you. No experience necessary\, just br
 ing your enthusiasm and maybe a friend or two! Get ready to sip on some del
 icious brews while you get crafty (one drink ticket included with ticket). 
 Don't miss out on this fun and relaxing event - reserve your spot now!
