BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260909T210000Z
DTEND:20260910T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20261003T143422Z
UID:4j6jr49grhfebv9b8g8n2c771u@google.com
CREATED:20260713T131442Z
DESCRIPTION:The countdown is on! Join us as we kick off Watermelon Pickers'
  Fest a day early with an evening of great music\, good friends\, local bee
 r\, and bluegrass here at Chilly Hollow Brewing.\nWhether you're already ca
 mping at the festival with Early Entry\, you're a local looking for a fun n
 ight out\, or you're curious about what Watermelon Pickers' Fest is all abo
 ut\, this is the perfect way to start the weekend.\n🎶 5:00 PM – Community 
 Jam\nBring your instrument and join an informal bluegrass jam. Everyone is 
 welcome to play\, listen\, or simply soak in the atmosphere.\n🎵 7:00 PM – 
 Live Music with the Short Hill Mountain Boys\nA longtime Watermelon Pickers
 ' Fest favorite\, the Short Hill Mountain Boys always bring high-energy blu
 egrass\, tight harmonies\, and plenty of fun. They'll have everyone ready f
 or an unforgettable festival weekend!\n🍺 Enjoy Chilly Hollow's handcrafted
  beers\, grab a pint with friends\, or take some beer to-go for your campsi
 te or home.\n🍉 Festival Fundraiser\nAdmission is free and open to everyone
 ! We'll be accepting donations to support Watermelon Pickers' Fest. A **sug
 gested donation of $10** is appreciated\, but completely optional.\n🛍️ Be 
 the first to shop exclusive\, limited-edition festival merchandise\, availa
 ble only while supplies last! Featured items include:\n• Special-edition fe
 stival T-shirts and zip-up hoodies featuring original artwork by local arti
 st Jordan Xu\n• Beautiful hand-thrown ceramic mugs by Erika Marie Pottery\n
 • And more surprises to come!\n🎟️ Still need your Watermelon Pickers' Fest
  tickets? No problem! Last-minute festival tickets will be available for pu
 rchase at the pre-party.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260713T134233Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Watermelon Pickers Fest: Road to Watermelon Pre-Party
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
