DESCRIPTION:Join us at 669 Chilly Hollow Rd in Berryville with your hot rod
 s and classic vehicles at 5pm on the 2nd and 4th Fridays of September and O
 ctober this fall (weather permitting)!\n\nEnjoy great beer\, dinner\, a rel
