DTSTAMP:20261003T143422Z
UID:2l4jikuo8d9jaq4dr1a2uo2sp9@google.com
CREATED:20260821T141459Z
DESCRIPTION:We partnered with the Clarke County Historical Association on a
  special historic brew\, Carter’s Gold\, inspired by the ales enjoyed in th
 e American colonies during the 18th century. This limited-release Dorset Go
 lden Ale is crafted with Virginia Chinook hops and English pale malts that 
 were ground at the historic Burwell-Morgan Mill\, creating a unique connect
 ion between Clarke County’s milling heritage and one of the beer styles com
 monly found in colonial taverns.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260824T161444Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Beer Release: Carter's Gold
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
