 /a><br><br>Erika will teach you basic hand building techniques so you can b
 e successful in creating your own unique planter. All ages and experience l
 evels are welcome! Food and drinks are available for purchase at the brewer
 y.  *Plants not included*<br>Erika will take your pieces back to her studio
  in Berryville to be fired after the workshop. You can choose to come glaze
  at the studio after your piece has been fired or choose a color at the end
  of class for Erika to glaze for you. Pickup will be at the studio in Berry
 ville located at 11 S Church St.
