 <br>On Thursday\, August 14\, swing by to grab your limited-edition Virgini
 a Beer Day pint glass and get $5 fills and refills of light beer in it all 
 day.<br><br>By taking part\, you're supporting local beer and helping our t
 eam grow. A portion of every glass helps fund our attendance at the Virgini
 a Brewers Conference\, where brewery professionals from across the state co
 me together to connect\, learn\, and get better at what we do.<br><br>Learn
  more at <a href="http://virginiabeerday.com/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJp
 ZBExbHVldzdLUXAxcWJDdGVMbwEe6jBNBmFftNArXR6wV2HyULow6PMqnYQUUuxY5AOy3gRaK1X
 Mrw6Io49f3WA_aem_lV6BiKDq6yoiKNCsuKJmPw" target="_blank">VirginiaBeerDay.co
 m</a> 🍻
