DESCRIPTION:Must register in advance here: <a href="https://www.eventbrite.
 com/e/charcuterie-workshop-tickets-1475348821039?aff=oddtdtcreator">Charcut
 erie Workshop Tickets\, Sun\, Aug 31\, 2025 at 11:00 AM | Eventbrite</a><br
 ><br>You are cordially invited to join Chilly Hollow Brewing's latest charc
 uterie workshop being offered by The Handcrafted Board!<br><p>Charcuterie a
 rtist\, Alexandra Klassen\, has paired up with her talented woodworking hus
 band to offer each guest the opportunity to take home a custom\, handcrafte
 d\, petite charcuterie board which will be complemented beautifully by a de
 lightful selection of fine cheese\, meat\, fruit and more!</p><p>Each guest
  will be instructed on the intricacies of making a company-worthy charcuter
 ie display that will look almost too pretty to eat. This class will be info
 rmative\, creative\, and above all\, so much fun!</p><p>Make it a well-dese
 rved holiday weekend date with your significant other\, a mother-daughter o
 uting or even a bridal party jaunt.</p><p>À Bientôt!</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260403T000749Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Charcuterie Board Workshop by The Handcrafted Board
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
