UID:mg4hsl6pdaehkod1odunglf6l8@google.com
CREATED:20251112T210306Z
DESCRIPTION:Help us kickoff a year of celebrating Virginia's 250th annivers
 ary and a year of special events all around Clarke County!\n\nThe Clarke Co
 unty VA250 Committee and Chilly Hollow Brewing invite you out to kick off a
  year of celebrating Virginia and America's 250th anniversary and a year of
  special events all around Clarke County! This free\, family friendly event
  will feature beverages\, traditional banjo music\, Revolutionary War re-en
 actors\, colonial seamstressing\, and face painting. Members of the Clarke 
 County VA250 committee will also speak about programs you can look forward 
 to throughout the year.\n\nMark your calendars!
LAST-MODIFIED:20260121T152240Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:VA250 Kickoff
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
