UID:54isv78uqpdjggba5mv9spb5s3@google.com
CREATED:20260910T155733Z
DESCRIPTION:\nJoin the Clarke County Education Foundation at Chilly Hollow 
 Brewing on Friday\, September 25 (9 2 5) from 5 to 9 for Dolly Day 🪩📖\n\n
 🍔 Come hungry! 10% of food sales from 5 to 9 will go toward initial fundin
 g of Dolly's Imagination Library in Clarke County led by the Clarke County 
 Education Foundation (CCEF)\n📚The Imagination Library delivers a high-qual
 ity\, age-appropriate book to children from birth to age 5 every month at n
 o cost to their family\n🤝 Dolly Day @ CHBCo is just the kickoff to CCEF's 
 goal of raising $50\,000\, which will sustain five years of the Imagination
  Library program to every interested child in our home county\n💅 LOOKALIKE
  CONTEST! We'll give away a $25 gift card to the best dressed Dolly.\n\n"If
  you can read\, you can do anything." - Dolly Parton
LAST-MODIFIED:20260918T172057Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Dolly Parton Day benefiting Clarke County Education Foundation
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
