 eventbrite.com/e/1983822401205?aff=oddtdtcreator" target="_blank">https://w
 ww.eventbrite.com/e/1983822401205?aff=oddtdtcreator</a><br><br>🥚🥚🥚<br><b
 r>Hop on over to our playground on <strong><strong>Friday\, April 3rd</stro
 ng></strong> for an Egg Hunt! <p><strong><strong>Please register for your i
 ndividual little bunnies' appropriate time slots to help us prepare:</stron
 g></strong></p><ul><li>3pm: ages 0-3</li><li>4pm: ages 4-7</li><li>5pm: age
 s 8-12</li></ul><p>We won't ID your kids...but please<strong><strong> no on
 e over 12 </strong></strong>and no crossing over into different age groups.
 </p><p>Everyone receives the same prize\, no matter how many eggs in their 
 basket--except the lucky duck in each age group who finds the most eggs wil
 l get something even bigger &amp\; better!</p>
