CREATED:20260507T125224Z
DESCRIPTION:Tickets: https://square.link/u/83GRJMsC\n\nJoin Sourdough by AC
  for Sip & Sourdough™: Beyond the Basics—an elevated\, hands-on sourdough w
 orkshop designed for bakers ready to build more confidence and consistency 
 in their sourdough baking. Through hands-on rotating stations\, you’ll lear
 n advanced techniques like hydration\, fermentation\, scoring\, inclusions\
 , and troubleshooting while creating your own custom inclusion loaf to take
  home and bake. This workshop is designed for bakers already familiar with 
 basic sourdough techniques and starter care.\n\nYour $95 ticket includes:\n
 • One drink ticket from Chilly Hollow—one pint of draft beer or glass of ho
 use wine (non-alcoholic options also available)\n• Hands-on advanced sourdo
 ugh workshop with rotating technique stations\n• Learn hydration\, fermenta
 tion\, scoring\, inclusions\, and troubleshooting techniques\n• Shape your 
 own custom inclusion loaf to take home and bake\n• Bread lame to take home\
 n• Printed Advanced Techniques Workbook with guides and troubleshooting tip
 s\n• Guided sourdough tasting experience\n• Access to the Sourdough by AC A
 lumni Members Group for ongoing support\, tips\, and troubleshooting after 
 the class
LAST-MODIFIED:20260702T185108Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Sip & Sourdough: Beyond the Basics
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
